      "id": 116844,
      "name": "peterrecore",
      "username": "peterrecore",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b77776/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-10T02:13:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was not able to find anything besides Heroscape. &nbsp;I have been working on different DIY solutions. &nbsp;I have been building Spiff's papercraft buildings, linked to by kitmehsu - they look awesome! &nbsp;I have also built foamcore terrain for the Insula side of the map by cutting 1/2 inch foamcore to the right size. &nbsp; &nbsp;Both techniques make the map really come alive. &nbsp;I suspect the foam core will hold up better for traveling, and the papercraft buildings will stay at home to remain looking good. &nbsp;</p>",
