      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c4cdca/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-11T22:46:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Having cut foam core for all the tiles, I really recommend it as a starting point. Cutting all the hex forms is somewhat tedious, but it doesn't require any skill or special ability and all the equipment is stuff that is either really cheap (foam core, glue) or things you probably already have (a scanner).</p>",
